:INFO
Art. 21 Enforcement
The Cantons shall enforce this Ordinance unless enforcement is specifically assigned to a federal authority.
|

:INFO
Art. 22 Repeal and amendment of current legislation
1 The Ordinance of 22 August 1990 on Beverage Containers is repealed.
2 ...
|

:NOTE
Para. 1 — [AS 1990 1480; 1995 5505; 1998 832]
Para. 2 — Repealed by No IV 33 of the Ordinance of 22 Aug. 2007 on the Formal Revision of Federal Legislation, with effect from 1 Jan. 2008 (AS 2007 4477).
|

:INFO
Art. 23 Commencement
1 This Ordinance comes into force on 1 January 2001, subject to paragraph 2.
2 DETEC shall determine the commencement date for Articles 9–14, 16 and 17 to coincide with the enactment of the Ordinance on the Level of the Prepaid Disposal Fee for Glass Beverage Containers (Art. 10 para. 2).
|

:NOTE
Para. 2 — In accordance with Art. 2 of the Ordinance of 7 Sept. 2001 on the Level of the Prepaid Disposal Fee for Glass Beverage Containers, those article came in force 1 Jan. 2002 (SR 814.621.4).

